{title: Muskaan Jhooti Hai}
{artist: Ram Sampath Talaash}
{key: G#}

{c: Verse 1}
[G#]Raat mein hi [G#]jaagte hain,        [B]Yeh gu [C#m]naahon ke [D#m]ghar
[G#]Inki raahein [G#]khole baahein,        [B]Jo bhi [C#m]aaye i [D#m]dhar
[G#]Aa [G]haa... [F#] [F]
Yeh hai [C#m]gumraahon ka [D#m]rasta,        [G#]Muskaanein jhooti hai
[G#]Pehchanein jhooti hai,        Rangeeni [B]hai [C#m]chhay [D#m]i
[G#]Phir bhi hai tanhaayi,        Kal inhi galiyon mein
In masli kaliyon mein,        Toh yeh dhoom thi
Jo rooh pyaasi hai,        Jismein udaasi hai
Woh hai ghoomti,        Sabko talaash wohi
Samjhe ye kaash koi,        Yeh hai [C#m]gumraahon ka [D#m]rasta
[G#]Muskaanein jhooti hai,        [G#]Pehchanein jhooti hai
Rangeeni [B]hai [C#m]chhay [D#m]i,        [G#]Phir bhi hai tanhaayi
Halke ujaalo mein,        Halke andhero mein jo ik raaz hai
Kyu kho gaya hai woh,        Kya ho gaya hai ki woh naraaz hai
Aye raat itna bataa, tujhko to hoga pata,        [G#] [G] [F#] [F]
